		half-buffer size always 64 bit word aligned. Typical minimum BUFFERSIZE value 0x010 i.e. 16 bytes, typical
		maximum value 0x1000 i.e. 4096 bytes.</description>
              <lsb>0</lsb>
              <msb>12</msb>
              <enumeratedValues>
