              <field>
                <name>TIMEACCUM</name>
                <description>Contains a snapshot of the resampler time accumulator captured when the ED/AGC enables the SCP output (when enabled with TIME_ACCUM_ENABLE=1).The snaphot stores the most significant 24-bits of the fractional part of the resampler time accumulator.Note that TIME_ACCUM_ENABLE is cleared once the snapshot is captured.</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>23</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
