                <description>Number of payload bytes after which PHY_RX_Request is deasserted.This value is set such that PHY-RX-Request is asserted till MAC hardware checkswhether MAC address of receiving packet is matching with expected address,i.e., this number should cover more than 10 bytes of MPDU.Typical value is 20 considering A-MPDU and some margin for MAC address matching.</description>
