            <resetValue>0x00003E70</resetValue>
            <size>0x20</size>
            <fields>
              <field>
                <name>LGLNASWITCHPOINTTABLE3</name>
                <description>lnaSwitchPointDbm for LNA stage 3, where lnaSwitchPointDbm is defined as:The value of RF input power in dBm which meets the following equation:rfRssiVal3Bit = lnaSwitchPointDbm + LG_RSSI_INCR_POWER_FACTOR * (rfInPowerDbm - lnaSwitchPointDbm)'This value is 7-bit signed. Default value is -16.</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>6</msb>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>LGLNASWITCHPOINTTABLE4</name>
                <description>lnaSwitchPointDbm for LNA stage 4, where lnaSwitchPointDbm is defined as:The value of RF input power in dBm which meets the following equation:rfRssiVal3Bit = lnaSwitchPointDbm + LG_RSSI_INCR_POWER_FACTOR * (rfInPowerDbm - lnaSwitchPointDbm)'This value is 7-bit signed. Default value is -4.</description>
                <lsb>7</lsb>
                <msb>13</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
          </register>
          <register>
            <name>WLANAGCMONITOR</name>
