            <fields>
              <field>
                <name>WLANRXPCPEFIELD</name>
                <description>Selects packet type:0: LSIG (L)1: LDATA (L)2: HTSIG (L)3: HTDATA (HT)4: VHTSIGA (L)5: VHTSIGB (HT)6: VHTDATA (VHT)7: RLSIG (L)8: HESIGA_SU (HT)9: HESIGA_X (HT)10 : HESIGA_ER (HT)11 : HESIGA_MU (HT)12 : HESIGB (VHT)13 : HEDATA_SU (HE)14 : HEDATA_ER (HE)15 : HEDATA_MU (HE)Packet types 0-3 (Legacy, HT_MF, HT_GF, VHT) are in Pre-HE group with OFDM symbol length of 3.2us.HE packet has 12.8us OFDM symbol length.NOTE: Whenever field is configured the initial state of scrambler will be set accordingly.Scrambler is used within CPE block to generate PN sequence for pilot sign generation. PN sequencehas 127 elements and cyclically repeats after 127 OFDM symbols.</description>
