                <description>When TXSCP_DEBUG=0: In phase output sample. Valid when SAMPLE_VALID = 1. To acknowledge sample has been read, write any value to TXSCP_SAMPLE register.When TXSCP_DEBUG=1: Live state of the valid flow control signals0: TX-SCP WR1: Pre-Interpolalation CFR Input2: Pre-Interpolalation CFR Output3: Interpolalation Filter Output4: Post-Interpolalation CFR Output5: Resampler CFR Output6: Mixer Output7: DPD Output8: Gain Angle Output9: IQ Imbalance Output10: Phase Compensation Filter Output11: DC Offset Output12: Synchroniser Input13: Synchroniser Output Pre-Holdoff14: Synchroniser Output Post-Holdoff15: Pre-interpolation IQ Imbalance</description>
