                <description>48-bit word-aligned based address in global memory at which to start writing the trace of values logged by the DCP.Two 24-bit items are logged:1. 24-bit word containing a timestamp in bits [23:6] andDCP channel ID in bits [5:0].2. 24-bit MA register value.</description>
                <lsb>1</lsb>
                <msb>19</msb>
              </field>
