                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>1</msb>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>WLANEDCABACKOFFCONTROLVALUE</name>
                <description>1. If BACKOFF_CONTROL_OPERATION_ADD is set, Add value preset in WLAN_EDCA_BACKOFF_CONTROL (Bit's B2 to B16 ) to backOffNumber2. If BACKOFF_CONTROL_OPERATION_SUB is set, subtract backOffNumber from WLAN_EDCA_BACKOFF_CONTROL(Bit's B2 to B16) ifbackOffNumber is greater than equal to WLAN_EDCA_BACKOFF_CONTROL(Bit's B2 to B16) else replace backOffNumber withWLAN_EDCA_BACKOFF_CONTROL (Bit's B2 to B16)3. If BACKOFF_CONTROL_OPERATION_LIMIT_CHECK_AND_REPLACE is set, replace backOffNumber from WLAN_EDCA_BACKOFF_CONTROL(Bit's B17 to B23) ifbackOffNumber is greater than WLAN_EDCA_BACKOFF_CONTROL(Bit's B2 to B16)</description>
                <lsb>2</lsb>
                <msb>16</msb>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>WLANEDCABACKOFFCONTROLREPLACEVALUE</name>
                <description>If BACKOFF_CONTROL_OPERATION_LIMIT_CHECK_AND_REPLACE is set,replace backOffNumber from WLAN_EDCA_BACKOFF_CONTROL(Bit's B17 to B23) ifbackOffNumber is greater than WLAN_EDCA_BACKOFF_CONTROL(Bit's B2 to B16)</description>
                <lsb>17</lsb>
                <msb>23</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
